          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and saying, “Lord, my servant is lying paralyzed at home, in terrible distress.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said to him, “I will come and heal him.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the centurion answered him, “Lord, I am not worthy to have you come under my roof; but only say the word, and my servant will be healed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I am a man under authority, with soldiers under me; and I say to one, ‘Go,’ and he goes, and to another, ‘Come,’ and he comes, and to my slave, ‘Do this,’ and he does it.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jesus heard him, he marveled, and said to those who followed him, “Truly, I say to you, not even",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Other ancient authorities read",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "with no one",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " in Israel have I found such faith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
