          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he touched her hand, and the fever left her, and she rose and served him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That evening they brought to him many who were possessed with demons; and he cast out the spirits with a word, and healed all who were sick. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
