            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " This was to fulfil what was spoken by the prophet Isaiah, “He took our infirmities and bore our diseases.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
