          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And behold, there arose a great storm on the sea, so that the boat was being swamped by the waves; but he was asleep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they went and woke him, saying, “Save, Lord; we are perishing.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
